<div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id6192_50466f-8a alignfull wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column6192_4356f0-d6"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-palette-color-14-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-289d53d9b7398d01df7c55d96587f5c6" style="padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);font-size:clamp(18.959px, 1.185rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.863), 30px);letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.2;text-transform:none">Enhance community well-being and drive meaningful change through philanthropic resources, collaboration, nonprofit leadership, and grant-making. </h2>



<p class="has-palette-color-14-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-0366184e05922e74e84a444ebb13b7ad">The Foun­da­tion man­ages over $1&nbsp;mil­lion in assets, and our annu­al col­lab­o­ra­tive event, The Tin Cup Challenge, has raised over $26.9&nbsp;mil­lion for local&nbsp;nonprofits.</p>
</div></div>

</div></div>

