<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column6192_080051-65 inner-column-1"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h3 class="kt-adv-heading6192_a6d49f-db wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading6192_a6d49f-db">Community Impact</h3>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image6192_dcbee8-e2"><figure class="aligncenter size-full kb-image-is-ratio-size"><div class="kb-is-ratio-image kb-image-ratio-square"><img data-opt-id=1143582559  data-opt-src="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:1280/h:1920/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/230823_tc_awrds_0390_-1-scaled.jpg"  alt="" decoding="async" width="1707" height="2560" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%201707%202560%22%20width%3D%221707%22%20height%3D%222560%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%221707%22%20height%3D%222560%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="" class="kb-img wp-image-50960" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=1143582559  alt="" decoding="async" width="1707" height="2560" src="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:1280/h:1920/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/230823_tc_awrds_0390_-1-scaled.jpg" alt="" class="kb-img wp-image-50960" srcset="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:1280/h:1920/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:1280/h:1920/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/230823_tc_awrds_0390_-1-scaled.jpg 1707w, https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:600/h:900/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:1280/h:1920/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/230823_tc_awrds_0390_-1-scaled.jpg 600w, https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:1280/h:1920/q:60/g:sm/f:best/dpr:2/https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:1280/h:1920/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/230823_tc_awrds_0390_-1-scaled.jpg 2x" sizes="(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px" /></noscript></div></figure></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column6192_b32a25-ba"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="has-palette-color-14-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-42aa65e32d050963be74155ae66953fb">The Community Foundation of Teton Valley elevates lives through the power of generosity. For 18 years, we have offered donor services, impactful grants, and philanthropic stability while serving as leaders, catalysts, and a resource.</p>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<div style="height:178px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-palette-color-14-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-b0dc8768cc27b428f2899db0ac2a7ff5" style="font-size:clamp(48.588px, 3.037rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 3.704), 96px);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.05px;line-height:1">$6.87M+</h2>



<p class="has-palette-color-14-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-566a8c690b0294a55265d298481cfe8f"><strong>Total Grants &amp; Programs Awarded</strong></p>



<p class="has-palette-color-14-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1abd837af79c8bba3b9d2dcb3bb31353">Since 2008, the Community Foundation of Teton Valley has awarded millions through the Tin Cup Challenge, Competitive Grants, Youth Philanthropy, and Opportunity Grants.</p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-palette-color-14-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-d1ce1cd1f2a8f6893e3208976b08c4de" style="font-size:clamp(48.588px, 3.037rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 3.704), 96px);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.05px;line-height:1">$30.8M+</h2>



<p class="has-palette-color-14-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6d548279aeaaad051301b81c45c4a9f8"><strong>Total Gifts Accepted</strong></p>



<p class="has-palette-color-14-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-a74276b72145e1c260d15a4d8c4abe96">Directly invested in Teton Valley&#8217;s nonprofits since 2008 through the Community Foundation of Teton Valleys&#8217; fundraising efforts.</p>



<div style="height:178px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-palette-color-14-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-69dca1f2d1fcb84bbdf9e1ad43e1fac0" style="font-size:clamp(48.588px, 3.037rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 3.704), 96px);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.05px;line-height:1">$3.5M+</h2>



<p class="has-palette-color-14-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1d975ce234c1892a0d348215b2edf07e"><strong>Total Assets Managed</strong> </p>



<p class="has-palette-color-14-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4909c6960ab9b35df7d049659d9f4b01">The Community Foundation of Teton Valley manages Donor-Advised Funds, Scholarships, Agency Funds, and more.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></div>

</div></div>

