<h3 class="has-link-color wp-elements-6bce5637001860a8fe00ca8391c8a70a wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-palette-color-14-color">Annual Tin Cup Challenge Kicks Off on March 10</h3>

<div style="line-height:1.4;" class="has-link-color wp-elements-444c516b5525574b8361d25b7e315ab9 wp-block-post-excerpt has-text-color has-palette-color-14-color"><p class="wp-block-post-excerpt__excerpt">The Community Foundation of Teton Valley is pleased to announce the launch of the 19th Annual Tin Cup Challenge and the official opening of the application period. A Kick-Off Meeting will be held on Tuesday, March&hellip;</p><p class="wp-block-post-excerpt__more-text"><a class="wp-block-post-excerpt__more-link" href="https://cftetonvalley.org/annual-tin-cup-challenge-kicks-off-on-march-10/">Read More</a></p></div>
