<div style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.4; padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-top:-5px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;" class="has-link-color wp-elements-7e39c22f9572382a65dc6247751c725f wp-block-post-excerpt has-text-color has-palette-color-14-color"><p class="wp-block-post-excerpt__excerpt">Dear Friend, Because of your generosity, 2025 marked a defining year for philanthropy in Teton Valley. Your support helped make this year’s&nbsp;Tin Cup Challenge&hellip;</p><p class="wp-block-post-excerpt__more-text"><a class="wp-block-post-excerpt__more-link" href="https://cftetonvalley.org/with-your-support-a-record-year-for-teton-valley/">Read More</a></p></div></div></div>

